Subject: [PATCH 01/10] holder: official base v1.5.1 binary staged+verified
 (tarball 6779c45d, binary 9c44836d) and validated offline

- tools/stage_release.py: digest/size-checked download, single-member extraction; BINARY.json pin
- every rendered flag found in the real rpc --help; launcher pins the official binary sha
- drop CLI --minimal/--full: download-generated reth.toml keeps prune + 500k static-file segments
  (CLI --minimal rewrites prune config and forces 10k segments); preflight checks reth.toml profile
- preflight runs --version/help on installed bytes; review-only mode for placeholder L1 endpoints
- real-binary offline fixture under the real launcher: loopback RPC 0x2105, L1-less startup exit 1,
  node-written default reth.toml refused; operator-preflight.sh; 2 new mutants
