+          Initial backoff delay, in milliseconds, between retries of the L1 JSON-RPC calls used to resolve the unsafe block signer address from L1
+          
+          [env: BASE_NODE_P2P_UNSAFE_BLOCK_SIGNER_RETRY_INITIAL_DELAY=]
+          [default: 100]
+
+      --p2p.unsafe-block-signer.retry-max-delay <UNSAFE_BLOCK_SIGNER_RETRY_MAX_DELAY>
+          Maximum backoff delay, in milliseconds, between retries of the L1 JSON-RPC calls used to resolve the unsafe block signer address from L1
+          
+          [env: BASE_NODE_P2P_UNSAFE_BLOCK_SIGNER_RETRY_MAX_DELAY=]
